                qualification='Certificates and Source inputs preserve reproducibility. The operational calls retain their recorded absolute paths and exact Python/runtime requirements; this is not a claim of a portable mathematical replay on an arbitrary filesystem.',
                work_scope='Only the three unfinished census manuscripts and their shared controls. No complete corpus, source-PDF mirror or compiler cache.')
